abstract: >-
  Frozen replication package for the discovery-frame validity audit demonstrated
  on one public GitHub frame of AI-instruction path predicates (companion IST
  manuscript). Includes the mining pipeline (discover and filter), frozen study
  datasets, annotation worksheets, evaluation scripts, sensitivity analyses, and
  schema documents for replaying metadata-visible coding, reliability analysis,
  and functional-evidence inspection diagnostics under alternative targets and
  consensus rules. Replication material only: no manuscript LaTeX or PDFs.
